 P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span> 仅对有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使用；函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}game\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2GameTree}_S(T,A)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varnothing\\in T\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\;(s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}game\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2GameTree}_S(T,A)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varnothing\\in T\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\;(s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a prefix-closed tree of finite move sequences; the variables <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,n\">\\(s,n\\)</span> are bound in the assertion and no unrelated order-tree predicate is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","le